        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>UV Shield+ is a dermatologist-formulated daily supplement designed for people who spend significant time outdoors.</p><p>Its five-ingredient formula is built around complementary nutritional and antioxidant pathways associated with environmental and UV-related skin stress. It combines niacinamide, Polypodium leucotomos, trans-resveratrol, EGCG, and spirulina rather than relying on a single ingredient or mechanism.</p>"
          }
        },
