        "heading": "Sun exposure is a daily reality.",
        "body": "<p>Your skin is a living organ constantly responding to the environment.</p><p>Outdoor exposure can influence oxidative stress, inflammatory signaling, cellular energy demands, and the skin's barrier systems.</p><p>That does not mean avoiding the outdoors. It means supporting skin through a layered routine:†</p>",
        "callout": "UV Shield+ belongs in the third layer. It does not replace the first."
      }
    },
